{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump. Dodge. Repeat. Improve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast, intense and challenging arcade platformer where every jump matters\u00a0\ud83c\udfae<br>Dive into a neon cyberpunk world full of lights, electronic music and impossible obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake\u2026<br>and you\u2019re back to the start\u00a0\ud83d\udca5\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have the reflexes?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but extremely challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay, brutal difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant Neon Cyberpunk visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electronic music synced with the action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for speedrunners and hardcore players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn patterns. Improve times. Break your limits.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to play. Hard to master.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a test of precision, memory and rhythm.<br>No luck.<br>Only skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only the patient reach the end</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy fast-reflex games, progressive difficulty and real challenges\u2026<br>Jump Jump Cyberpunk will test your nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go without failing?\u00a0\ud83d\ude28</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2340990?t=1770571271","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2340990?t=1770571271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340990/44223393b15e71053a5c93f94a0b9ae54bce7c53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770571271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340990/44223393b15e71053a5c93f94a0b9ae